{"source":"Scofield Reference Bible notes, 1917 (public domain). CrossWire module from the Wikisource 1917 text. Not the 1967 New Scofield.","notes":[{"bookSlug":"proverbs","chapter":1,"verse":7,"heading":"Book Introduction - Proverbs","body":"This collection of sententious sayings is divine wisdom applied to the earthly conditions of the people of God. That the Proverbs were Solomon's (Proverbs 1:1) implies no more than that he gathered into orderly arrangement sayings already current amongst the people, the wisdom of the Spirit, perhaps through many centuries (Ecclesiastes 12:9). Chapters 25-29 were current in Hezekiah's time (Ecclesiastes 25:1). Chapters 30 and 31 are by Agur and Lemuel. The book is in six parts:\nTo sons, 1-7.\nThe praise of wisdom, 8-9.\nThe folly of sin, 10-19.\nWarnings and instructions, 20-29.\nThe words of Agur, 30. The words of King Lemuel, 31.","kjvPhrase":"","webPhrase":"","letter":"a","kind":"verse","seeAlso":[]},{"bookSlug":"proverbs","chapter":1,"verse":7,"heading":"fear","body":"Also; Proverbs 1:29, (See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")","kjvPhrase":"fear","webPhrase":"fear","letter":"b","kind":"chain","seeAlso":[{"bookSlug":"psalms","chapter":19,"verse":9}]},{"bookSlug":"proverbs","chapter":1,"verse":12,"heading":"grave","body":"Heb. \"Sheol,\" (See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\").","kjvPhrase":"grave","webPhrase":"","letter":"a","kind":"chain","seeAlso":[{"bookSlug":"habakkuk","chapter":2,"verse":5}]},{"bookSlug":"proverbs","chapter":1,"verse":29,"heading":"fear","body":"Also; Proverbs 1:7. (See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\").","kjvPhrase":"fear","webPhrase":"fear","letter":"a","kind":"chain","seeAlso":[{"bookSlug":"psalms","chapter":19,"verse":9}]},{"bookSlug":"proverbs","chapter":2,"verse":5,"heading":"fear","body":"Also; Proverbs 3:7, (See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\").","kjvPhrase":"fear","webPhrase":"fear","letter":"a","kind":"chain","seeAlso":[{"bookSlug":"psalms","chapter":19,"verse":9}]},{"bookSlug":"proverbs","chapter":3,"verse":7,"heading":"fear","body":"Also; Proverbs 2:5 (See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")","kjvPhrase":"fear","webPhrase":"Fear","letter":"a","kind":"chain","seeAlso":[{"bookSlug":"psalms","chapter":19,"verse":9}]},{"bookSlug":"proverbs","chapter":5,"verse":5,"heading":"hell","body":"Heb. \"Sheol,\" (See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\")","kjvPhrase":"hell","webPhrase":"","letter":"a","kind":"chain","seeAlso":[{"bookSlug":"habakkuk","chapter":2,"verse":5}]},{"bookSlug":"proverbs","chapter":7,"verse":27,"heading":"hell","body":"Heb. \"Sheol,\" (See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\")","kjvPhrase":"hell","webPhrase":"","letter":"a","kind":"chain","seeAlso":[{"bookSlug":"habakkuk","chapter":2,"verse":5}]},{"bookSlug":"proverbs","chapter":8,"verse":1,"heading":"hell","body":"Heb. \"Sheol,\" (See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\")","kjvPhrase":"hell","webPhrase":"","letter":"a","kind":"chain","seeAlso":[{"bookSlug":"habakkuk","chapter":2,"verse":5}]},{"bookSlug":"proverbs","chapter":8,"verse":22,"heading":"The Lord possessed me","body":"That wisdom is more than the personification of an attribute of God, or of the will of God as best for man, but is a distinct adumbration of Christ, is sure to the devout mind. Proverbs 8:22-36; John 1:1-3; Colossians 1:17 can refer to nothing less than the Eternal Son of God.","kjvPhrase":"The Lord possessed me","webPhrase":"","letter":"a","kind":"verse","seeAlso":[]},{"bookSlug":"proverbs","chapter":9,"verse":18,"heading":"hell","body":"Heb. \"Sheol,\" (See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\")","kjvPhrase":"hell","webPhrase":"","letter":"a","kind":"chain","seeAlso":[{"bookSlug":"habakkuk","chapter":2,"verse":5}]},{"bookSlug":"proverbs","chapter":10,"verse":1,"heading":"foolish son","body":"A \"fool\" in Scripture is never a mentally deficient person, but rather one arrogant and self-sufficient; one who orders his life as if there were no God. See, for illustration, Luke 12:16-20. The rich man was not mentally deficient, but he was a \"fool\" because he supposed that his soul could live on the things in the barn, giving no thought to his eternal wellbeing.","kjvPhrase":"foolish son","webPhrase":"foolish son","letter":"a","kind":"word","seeAlso":[]},{"bookSlug":"proverbs","chapter":11,"verse":25,"heading":"liberal soul","body":"See; 2 Corinthians 9:6-10.","kjvPhrase":"liberal soul","webPhrase":"liberal soul","letter":"a","kind":"word","seeAlso":[]},{"bookSlug":"proverbs","chapter":14,"verse":26,"heading":"fear","body":"Also; Proverbs 15:16, (See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\").","kjvPhrase":"fear","webPhrase":"fear","letter":"a","kind":"chain","seeAlso":[{"bookSlug":"psalms","chapter":19,"verse":9}]},{"bookSlug":"proverbs","chapter":15,"verse":11,"heading":"hell","body":"Heb. \"Sheol,\" (See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\") , Job 26:6; Psalms 139:8.","kjvPhrase":"hell","webPhrase":"","letter":"a","kind":"chain","seeAlso":[{"bookSlug":"habakkuk","chapter":2,"verse":5}]},{"bookSlug":"proverbs","chapter":15,"verse":16,"heading":"fear","body":"Also; Proverbs 14:26, (See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\").","kjvPhrase":"fear","webPhrase":"fear","letter":"a","kind":"chain","seeAlso":[{"bookSlug":"psalms","chapter":19,"verse":9}]},{"bookSlug":"proverbs","chapter":15,"verse":24,"heading":"hell","body":"Heb. \"Sheol,\" (See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\")","kjvPhrase":"hell","webPhrase":"","letter":"a","kind":"chain","seeAlso":[{"bookSlug":"habakkuk","chapter":2,"verse":5}]},{"bookSlug":"proverbs","chapter":22,"verse":6,"heading":"train up a child","body":"See, Ephesians 6:4; 2 Timothy 3:15.","kjvPhrase":"train up a child","webPhrase":"Train up a child","letter":"a","kind":"word","seeAlso":[]},{"bookSlug":"proverbs","chapter":23,"verse":11,"heading":"redeemer","body":"Heb. \"goel,\" Redemp. (Kinsman type). (See Scofield \"Isaiah 59:20\").","kjvPhrase":"redeemer","webPhrase":"","letter":"a","kind":"chain","seeAlso":[{"bookSlug":"isaiah","chapter":59,"verse":20}]},{"bookSlug":"proverbs","chapter":23,"verse":14,"heading":"hell","body":"Heb. \"Sheol,\" (See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\").","kjvPhrase":"hell","webPhrase":"","letter":"a","kind":"chain","seeAlso":[{"bookSlug":"habakkuk","chapter":2,"verse":5}]},{"bookSlug":"proverbs","chapter":27,"verse":20,"heading":"grave","body":"Also; Proverbs 30:16, Heb. \"Sheol,\" (See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\").","kjvPhrase":"grave","webPhrase":"","letter":"a","kind":"chain","seeAlso":[{"bookSlug":"habakkuk","chapter":2,"verse":5}]},{"bookSlug":"proverbs","chapter":30,"verse":16,"heading":"grave","body":"Heb. \"Sheol,\" (See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\").","kjvPhrase":"grave","webPhrase":"","letter":"a","kind":"chain","seeAlso":[{"bookSlug":"habakkuk","chapter":2,"verse":5}]}]}
